# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AI Real Estate Agent — Environment Variables Template
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 
# INSTRUCTIONS:
#   1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env
#   2. Fill in each value with your API keys
#   3. Do NOT commit .env to Git — it contains secrets!
#   4. Add .env to .gitignore if not already there
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. GROQ LLM (Conversation Brain)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: Free tier of Groq — 100 API calls/minute unlimited
# MODEL: llama-3.3-70b-versatile (best free model for Arabic)
#
# HOW TO GET:
#   1. Go to https://console.groq.com
#   2. Sign up or log in
#   3. Navigate to API Keys
#   4. Create new API key
#   5. Copy the key (starts with "gsk_")
#
# FORMAT: gsk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GROQ_API_KEY=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. ELEVENLABS (Text-to-Speech for Arabic)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: High-quality AI voice synthesis
# COST: Free tier ~100k characters/month; paid plans start $5/month
#
# HOW TO GET API KEY:
#   1. Go to https://elevenlabs.io
#   2. Sign up or log in
#   3. Click your profile → Account
#   4. Copy API Key
#
# HOW TO GET VOICE ID:
#   1. In ElevenLabs dashboard, go to Voices
#   2. Browse Arabic voices (e.g., "Zahra" for female, "Almadi" for male)
#   3. Click on a voice to see its Voice ID
#   4. Copy the 24-character ID
#
# FORMAT API KEY: sk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# FORMAT VOICE ID: abc123def456ghi789jklm (24 chars)
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 3. GOOGLE SHEETS (Data Storage)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: Google Sheets API for reading/writing inventory & clients
# COST: Free (up to 500 req/100 sec)
#
# HOW TO GET SHEET ID:
#   1. Open your Google Sheet in browser
#   2. Look at URL: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/{SHEET_ID}/edit
#   3. Copy the SHEET_ID part (long alphanumeric string)
#
# HOW TO GET SERVICE ACCOUNT JSON:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com
#   2. Create or select a project
#   3. Enable "Google Sheets API"
#   4. Create Service Account → download JSON key file
#   5. Save to: config/service_account.json (create folder if needed)
#   6. SHARE YOUR GOOGLE SHEET with the service account email
#      (email is in the JSON file under "client_email")
#
# FORMAT SHEET ID: 1a2b3c4d5e6f7g8h9i0j1k2l (alphanumeric)
# FORMAT FILE PATH: config/service_account.json (relative path)
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=
GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=config/service_account.json

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 4. PARTNER SIP PROVIDER (Outbound Calls)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: VoIP provider for making outbound calls
# EXAMPLES: Vapi, Bandwidth, Twilio, custom SIP gateway
# COST: Varies by provider (typically $0.01-0.05 per minute)
#
# HOW TO GET:
#   1. Sign up with your preferred provider
#   2. Get API endpoint URL (e.g., https://api.vapi.ai/calls)
#   3. Generate API key from your dashboard
#   4. Get a caller ID number (Saudi format: +966XXXXXXXXX)
#
# FORMAT API BASE: https://api.example.com
# FORMAT API KEY: sk_xxxxx... or similar
# FORMAT CALLER ID: +966XXXXXXXXX (include country code)
PARTNER_API_BASE=
PARTNER_API_KEY=
SIP_CALLER_ID=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 5. WEBHOOK SECURITY (Make.com Integration)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: Secret token to authenticate Make.com requests
# PURPOSE: Prevents unauthorized access to your webhook endpoints
#
# HOW TO GENERATE:
#   Option 1 - Use OpenSSL:
#     openssl rand -hex 32
#
#   Option 2 - Use Python:
#     python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_hex(32))"
#
#   Option 3 - Use online generator (not recommended for production):
#     https://www.random.org/strings/
#
# THEN:
#   1. Paste the generated secret below
#   2. Copy the SAME value into your Make.com HTTP module header
#      as "x-webhook-secret"
#
# FORMAT: Random hex string (64 characters)
WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 6. OPTIONAL: Agent Branding (Saudi Dialect)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# WHAT IT IS: Agent's identity in the conversation (Arabic text)
# DEFAULT: AGENT_NAME="فهد", COMPANY_NAME="الشركة"
#
# CUSTOMIZE:
#   - AGENT_NAME: Agent's first name (e.g., محمد, نور, سارة)
#   - COMPANY_NAME: Your company name in Arabic
#
# Note: These appear in system prompts and greeting messages
#
# FORMAT: Arabic text (UTF-8)
AGENT_NAME=فهد
COMPANY_NAME=الشركة


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUICK REFERENCE: Where to Get Each Key
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# GROQ_API_KEY             → https://console.groq.com/keys
# ELEVENLABS_API_KEY       → https://elevenlabs.io/account
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID      → https://elevenlabs.io/app/speech-synthesis
# GOOGLE_SHEET_ID          → Your Google Sheet URL
# GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT   → https://console.cloud.google.com/iam-admin/serviceaccounts
# PARTNER_API_BASE         → Your SIP provider's API docs
# PARTNER_API_KEY          → Your SIP provider's dashboard
# SIP_CALLER_ID            → Your SIP provider (your phone number)
# WEBHOOK_SECRET           → Generate: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
